{"id":"reference/Operators","kind":"langref","title":"运算符","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Operators","file":"reference/Operators.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Operators","text":"运算符"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Table-of-Operators","text":"运算符表"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Precedence","text":"优先级"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Operators\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Operators/#Operators\">运算符</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 不支持运算符重载。看到一个运算符时，可以确定它只执行下表中的某项操作，不会执行其他操作。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Table-of-Operators\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Operators/#Table-of-Operators\">运算符表</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">名称</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">语法</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">类型</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">说明</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">示例</th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>加法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a + b\na += b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Default-Operations\">溢出</a>。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#addWithOverflow\">@addWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> + <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">7</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>回绕加法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a +% b\na +%= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>采用二进制补码回绕行为。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#addWithOverflow\">@addWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0xffffffff</span>) +% <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>饱和加法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a +| b\na +|= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span>) +| <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span>)</code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>减法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a - b\na -= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Default-Operations\">溢出</a>。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#subWithOverflow\">@subWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> - <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> == -<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>回绕减法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a -% b\na -%= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>采用二进制补码回绕行为。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#subWithOverflow\">@subWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) -% <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>饱和减法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a -| b\na -|= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) -| <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>取负</td>\n          <td><pre><code>-a</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Default-Operations\">溢出</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>-<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> - <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>回绕取负</td>\n          <td><pre><code>-%a</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>采用二进制补码回绕行为。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>-%<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, -<span class=\"tok-number\">128</span>) == -<span class=\"tok-number\">128</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>乘法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a * b\na *= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Default-Operations\">溢出</a>。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#mulWithOverflow\">@mulWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> * <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>回绕乘法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a *% b\na *%= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>采用二进制补码回绕行为。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#mulWithOverflow\">@mulWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">200</span>) *% <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">144</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>饱和乘法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a *| b\na *|= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">200</span>) *| <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>除法</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a / b\na /= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Default-Operations\">溢出</a>。</li>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Division-by-Zero\">除数为零</a>。</li>\n              <li>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floating-Point-Operations\">FloatMode.optimized 模式</a>下，对浮点数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Division-by-Zero\">除数为零</a>。</li>\n              <li>有符号整数操作数必须在编译时已知且为正数。其他情况请改用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#divTrunc\">@divTrunc</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#divFloor\">@divFloor</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#divCeil\">@divCeil</a> 或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#divExact\">@divExact</a>。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">10</span> / <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>取余</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a % b\na %= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对整数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Division-by-Zero\">除数为零</a>。</li>\n              <li>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floating-Point-Operations\">FloatMode.optimized 模式</a>下，对浮点数可能导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Division-by-Zero\">除数为零</a>。</li>\n              <li>有符号数或浮点数操作数必须在编译时已知且为正数。其他情况请改用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#rem\">@rem</a> 或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#mod\">@mod</a>。</li>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">10</span> % <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位左移</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &lt;&lt; b\na &lt;&lt;= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>将所有位向左移动，并在最低有效位补零。</li>\n              <li><code>b</code> 必须在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时已知</a>，或者其类型的位数等于 <code>a</code> 位数的以 2 为底的对数。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shlExact\">@shlExact</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shlWithOverflow\">@shlWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">0b1</span> &lt;&lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b100000000</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>饱和按位左移</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &lt;&lt;| b\na &lt;&lt;|= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shlExact\">@shlExact</a>。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shlWithOverflow\">@shlWithOverflow</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) &lt;&lt;| <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位右移</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &gt;&gt; b\na &gt;&gt;= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>左操作数为无符号数时执行<strong>逻辑移位</strong>，将所有位向右移动，并在最高有效位补零。</li>\n\n              <li>左操作数为有符号数时执行<strong>算术移位</strong>，将所有位向右移动；当且仅当原最高有效位为一时，在最高有效位补一。</li>\n\n              <li><code>b</code> 必须在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时已知</a>，或者其类型的位数等于 <code>a</code> 位数的以 2 为底的对数。</li>\n              <li>另见 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#shrExact\">@shrExact</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">0b1010</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b101</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位与</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &amp; b\na &amp;= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">0b011</span> &amp; <span class=\"tok-number\">0b101</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b001</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位或</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a | b\na |= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">0b010</span> | <span class=\"tok-number\">0b100</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b110</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位异或</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a ^ b\na ^= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-number\">0b011</span> ^ <span class=\"tok-number\">0b101</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b110</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>按位取反</td>\n          <td><pre><code>~a</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>~<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0b10101111</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">0b01010000</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>可选值解包（带默认值）</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 <code>a</code> 为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code>，返回 <code>b</code>（“默认值”）；否则返回 <code>a</code> 解包后的值。注意，<code>b</code> 可以是 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/noreturn/#noreturn\">noreturn</a> 类型的值。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> value: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> unwrapped = value <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\nunwrapped == <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>可选值解包</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a.?</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>等价于：<pre><code>a <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> value: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span>;\nvalue.? == <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>错误解包（带默认值）</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> b\na <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> |err| b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误联合</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 <code>a</code> 是一个 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span></code>，返回 <code>b</code>（“默认值”）；否则返回 <code>a</code> 解包后的值。注意，<code>b</code> 可以是 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/noreturn/#noreturn\">noreturn</a> 类型的值。<code>err</code> 就是该 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span></code>，位于表达式 <code>b</code> 的作用域内。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> value: <span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Broken;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> unwrapped = value <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\nunwrapped == <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>逻辑与</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a <span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span> b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">bool</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 <code>a</code> 为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>，则直接返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>，不求值 <code>b</code>；否则返回 <code>b</code>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-null\">false</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>逻辑或</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a <span class=\"tok-kw\">or</span> b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">bool</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 <code>a</code> 为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，则直接返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，不求值 <code>b</code>；否则返回 <code>b</code>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-null\">false</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>布尔非</td>\n          <td><pre><code>!a</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">bool</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>!<span class=\"tok-null\">false</span> == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>相等</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a == b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">bool</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">type</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#packed-struct\">packed struct</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 与 b 相等时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> == <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>空值检查</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a == <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 a 为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code>，返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>；否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> value: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n(value == <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>不等</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a != b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">bool</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">type</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 与 b 相等时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> != <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>非空检查</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a != <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>如果 a 为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code>，返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>；否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> value: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n(value != <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>大于</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &gt; b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 大于 b 时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> &gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>大于等于</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &gt;= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 大于等于 b 时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> &gt;= <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>小于</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &lt; b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 小于 b 时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>小于等于</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a &lt;= b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>a 小于等于 b 时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，否则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">false</span></code>。对操作数执行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Peer-Type-Resolution\">同级类型解析</a>。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> &lt;= <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>) == <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>数组拼接</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a ++ b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li>仅当 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 的长度都在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时已知</a>时可用。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mem = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).mem;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array1 = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>{<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>,<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array2 = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>{<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>,<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> together = array1 ++ array2;\nmem.eql(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, &amp;together, &amp;[_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>{<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>,<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>,<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>,<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>})</code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>指针解引用</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a.*</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td>指针解引用。</td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = &amp;x;\nptr.* == <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>取地址</td>\n          <td><pre><code>&amp;a</code></pre></td>\n          <td>全部类型</td>\n          <td>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = &amp;x;\nptr.* == <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span></code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>错误集合合并</td>\n          <td><pre><code>a || b</code></pre></td>\n          <td>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Set-Type\">错误集合类型</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </td>\n          <td><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Merging-Error-Sets\">合并错误集合</a></td>\n          <td>\n            <pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> A = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{One};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> B = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{Two};\n(A || B) == <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{One, Two}</code></pre>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Precedence\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Operators/#Precedence\">优先级</a></h3>\n\n      <pre><code>x() x[] x.y x.* x.?\na!b\nx{}\n!x -x -%x ~x &amp;x ?x\n* / % *% *| ||\n+ - ++ +% -% +| -|\n&lt;&lt; &gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;|\n&amp; ^ | <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span>\n== != &lt; &gt; &lt;= &gt;=\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">or</span>\n= *= *%= *|= /= %= += +%= +|= -= -%= -|= &lt;&lt;= &lt;&lt;|= &gt;&gt;= &amp;= ^= |=</code></pre>\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":163,"translated":163}}
